eS1NYUpnT3J4b1RsaHRLNHJEcE1YNEZjVHU3TjNKZ2hMNkduYnQ1NzRFNGstZ1FTYTNFQjRUX3M1T3dtZUNfUl9JbTdpUjF6dHFTdTRmYnU3c2Y2RWJaVW9feGJ4dUwtNUVXVmRxTTFIN2JXTWY3MGlIT3RsRU9XRndrT3J3U1F4Zkh6cklqSDE3eG55QXdvWHkwMUFaTGNHWDVXV3hnMEVDOVFwZ2JV?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Dr.Horton 2026 年第四季業績下滑：規模優勢遭遇獲利壓力"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-19","period":"2025-09-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/882184/000088218425000081/dhi-20250930.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"D.R. Horton, Inc. is the largest homebuilding company in the United States as measured by number of homes closed. We construct and sell homes through our operating divisions in 126 markets across 36 states. Our common stock is included in the S&P 500 Index and listed on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) and NYSE Texas under the ticker symbol \"DHI.\" Our listing on NYSE Texas became effective in June 2025. Unless the context otherwise requires, the terms \"D.R. Horton,\" the \"Company,\" \"we\" and \"our\" used herein refer to D.R. Horton, Inc., a Delaware corporation, and its predecessors and subsidiaries.","zh":"博士以已關閉房屋數量衡量，霍頓公司是美國最大的住宅建築公司。我們透過我們的營運部門在 36 個州的 126 個市場建造和銷售房屋。我們的普通股被納入標準普爾 500 指數，並在紐約證券交易所 (NYSE) 和 NYSE Texas 上市，股票代號為「DHI」。我們在德州紐約證券交易所的上市於 2025 年 6 月生效。除非上下文另有要求，本文中使用的術語「D.R. Horton」、「本公司」、「我們」和「我們的」均指 D.R. Horton。 Horton, Inc.（一家特拉華州公司）及其前身和子公司。"},{"en":"Our homebuilding business began in 1978 in Fort Worth, Texas, and our common stock has been publicly traded since 1992. We have expanded and diversified our homebuilding operations geographically over the years by investing capital and building teams of people in our existing markets, starting new operations in additional markets and acquiring other homebuilding companies. We have closed more than 1.2 million homes during our 47-year history, and we have been the largest volume homebuilder in the United States every year since 2002.","zh":"我們的住宅建築業務於 1978 年在德克薩斯州沃思堡開始，我們的普通股自 1992 年起公開交易。多年來，我們透過在現有市場投資資本和建立團隊、在其他市場開展新業務以及收購其他住宅建築公司，在地域上擴大和多元化我們的住宅建築業務。在 47 年的歷史中，我們已經關閉了超過 120 萬套房屋，自 2002 年以來，我們每年都是美國銷量最大的房屋建築商。"},{"en":"Our business operations consist of homebuilding, rental, a majority-owned residential lot development company, financial services and other activities. Homebuilding is our core business, generating 92% of consolidated revenues of $34.3 billion and $36.8 billion in fiscal 2025 and 2024, respectively, and 90% of consolidated revenues of $35.5 billion in fiscal 2023. Most of our homebuilding revenue is generated from the sale of completed homes and to a lesser extent from the sale of land and lots. Approximately 84% of our home sales revenue in fiscal 2025 was generated from the sale of single-family detached homes, with the remainder from the sale of attached homes, such as townhomes and duplexes. Our product offerings include a broad range of homes for entry-level, move-up, active adult and luxury buyers. Our homes generally range in size from 1,000 to 4,000 square feet and in price from ","zh":"我們的業務包括住宅建設、租賃、控股住宅地塊開發公司、金融服務和其他活動。住宅建築是我們的核心業務，分別佔 2025 財年和 2024 財年 343 億美元和 368 億美元綜合收入的 92%，以及 2023 財年 355 億美元綜合收入的 90%。我們的住宅建築收入大多來自已完工房屋的銷售，少量來自土地和地塊的銷售。 2025 財年，我們約 84% 的房屋銷售收入來自單戶獨立屋的銷售，其餘則來自聯排別墅和複式住宅等附屬房屋的銷售。我們的產品包括為入門級、升級級、活躍的成人和豪華買家提供的各種住宅。我們的房屋面積一般為 1,000 至 4,000 平方英尺，價格為"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We operate as a provider of residential housing in both the for sale and rental markets, which are highly competitive. We compete not only for homebuyers and renters, but also for desirable properties, raw materials, skilled labor and financing. We compete with local, regional and national homebuilding and rental companies and also with existing home sales and rental properties. We compete based on price, location, quality and design of our homes and on mortgage financing terms.","zh":"我們在競爭激烈的銷售和租賃市場上作為住宅供應商運作。我們不僅爭奪購屋者和租屋者，還爭奪理想的房產、原料、熟練勞動力和融資。我們與當地、地區和國家的住宅建築和租賃公司以及現有房屋銷售和租賃物業競爭。我們根據房屋的價格、位置、品質和設計以及抵押貸款融資條款進行競爭。"},{"en":"Competition to our financial services businesses includes other mortgage lenders and title companies, including national, regional and local mortgage banks and other financial institutions. Some of these competitors are subject to fewer governmental regulations and have greater access to capital than we do, may operate with different lending criteria and/or may offer a broader or more attractive array of financing and other products and services to potential customers. We strive to provide flexible, fairly priced financing alternatives subject to applicable regulations.","zh":"我們的金融服務業務的競爭包括其他抵押貸款機構和產權公司，包括國家、地區和地方抵押銀行和其他金融機構。其中一些競爭對手比我們受到的政府法規更少，並且獲得資本的機會更多，可能會採用不同的貸款標準和/或可能向潛在客戶提供更廣泛或更有吸引力的融資以及其他產品和服務。我們努力提供靈活、價格合理的融資方案，並遵守適用的法規。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Home Building Ops","val":31515500000,"zh":"住宅建設運營"},{"name":"Forestar Group","val":1662400000,"zh":"福星集團"},{"name":"Rental","val":1640400000,"zh":"出租"},{"name":"Financial Services","val":841200000,"zh":"金融服務"}],"total":34250400000},"prod":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Home Building Ops","val":31432000000,"zh":"住宅建設運營"},{"name":"Rental","val":1640400000,"zh":"出租"},{"name":"Financial Services","val":841200000,"zh":"金融服務"},{"name":"Land","val":336800000,"zh":"土地"}],"total":34250400000}},"peers":["LEN","PHM","TOL","KBH","BZH"]}}